{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"1984","name":"千岩牢固","desc":"千岩牢固","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/05/20/16314655/5bc28d41144bc84dad1c5bc5d05b7767_7626689243920624349.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基础信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\" 稀有度 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e4星/5星\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\" 获取途径 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1813\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/04/17/79683714/5bd62dddb981edae06087f872af6e31e_8487628360384306807.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"山脊守望\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1813/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1813/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e山脊守望\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e：不移Ⅰ～ Ⅳ 概率掉落（4星）；不移Ⅲ～ Ⅳ 概率掉落（5星）；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e合成台「还圣奥迹」获取；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"502145\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/08/28/50494840/d29726b96c9ee790cae261ddbc5f9989_3936286629804858604.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"圣言自明机\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e圣言自明机\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e定义获取。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"2件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e生命值提升20%\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"4件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e元素战技命中敌人后，使队伍中附近的所有角色攻击力提升20%，护盾强效提升30%，持续3秒。该效果每0.5秒至多触发一次。装备此圣遗物套装的角色处于队伍后台时，依然能触发该效果。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"4","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生之花","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"生之花：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"生之花：\",\"value\":[\"勋绩之花\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/5bc28d41144bc84dad1c5bc5d05b7767_2552804209099096369.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e以金箔制成的精致花朵，象征了其主人所获得的功勋与荣誉。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e在峭岩岸然作歌的过去，层岩巨渊曾有星辰陨落。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e星铁自无际夜空垂落而下，将尘土化为琉璃晶砂。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e凡人朝生暮死，帝君却亲手托付千岩军守护矿脉之责。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e深渊如洪流般涌出，千岩军则护送众多民众疏散逃离。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在矿工们的故事中，少数留在层岩巨渊的断后兵士们，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e亦与无名的夜叉一并奋战，最终同样牺牲在峭岩之间。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e即使山川随年月而改变，凡人与仙人的名姓也被遗忘，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e其勋绩却永无磨灭之时，正如这金箔之花般坚韧闪耀。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e自灾厄平息至今已有五百年，港城坚壁一如往日久安。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e兵士们骄傲佩戴的金花，正是先人的高贵牺牲的标志。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"5","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"死之羽","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"死之羽：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"死之羽：\",\"value\":[\"昭武翎羽\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/895416bf7c41e143bd5d1f12d069d570_533463270898382576.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e在仪仗场合佩戴的鹰翎，用以向外人显明璃月港的威严与决心。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e翱翔高天的猛禽遗落的翎羽，被千岩军作为武勋的标志而佩戴起来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e此种翎羽仅在仪仗场合佩戴，用以鼓舞民众，向外国来客显示威严。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e传说千岩军在礼仪场合佩戴的翎羽，最初来自无名的夜叉。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜叉在与深渊爪牙缠斗时散落的翎羽，被视为希望的象征。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e最终，勇猛的夜叉与无畏的凡人们皆沉睡在了深黑的渊薮。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e帝君感其牺牲，为之沉默良久，山石群岩亦悄然呢喃吁叹。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e民间亦有流言称守护层岩巨渊的无名夜叉并非受帝君之命，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e而是为了救赎久远的罪愆，为曾经的怯懦与逃避付出代偿。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不论真相为何，曾经翔游群云的夜叉已回归了自在的云雾。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在巨渊之下永眠的兵士，也就此永远存在流变的神话之中。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"6","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"时之沙","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"时之沙：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"时之沙：\",\"value\":[\"金铜时晷\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/e1f88db5edba6d979e969ca6a9374ca5_2225113573724303229.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e外观朴素的计时道具，在战乱的时代，一度是千岩军的制式装备。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e驱以日月之光的坚定时计，在白日无明的日子也能捕捉光芒。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e璃月被漆黑恶意威胁之刻，这尊时晷让战士记住白昼的温暖。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在夜叉身侧作战，凡人兵士亦难免身染业障，或遭杀伐波及。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e为避免被杀业吞噬，千岩兵士以时晷默默记录着厮杀的时刻。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e以统一的步调与规律，前一批凡人兵士撤下，便有下批换上。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e如是进退如一直至巨渊深处，夜叉与勇武之士并肩陨落之地。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e百年之后，这尊时晷被矿工发掘而出，灼灼星光下闪耀着金石光泽。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e市井传说称有着黑袍的藏家行走街市，以高价将此种金铜时晷收购。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e也有卖家试图打听其间原因，却皆被其人以各种借口说辞巧妙拦回，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e或许此人的目的为何，只有不息的时间终能做出足够合理的解答吧。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"7","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"空之杯","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"空之杯：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"空之杯：\",\"value\":[\"盟誓金爵\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/738a822e9d17d7a89a50e58722c28688_7135323050675185310.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e千岩军用以盟誓的金爵，依旧残留着丝丝酒香。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e千岩军初立的过去，璃月大地尚未尽褪蛮荒。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e城镇、乡村与部族的长老曾以金爵彼此盟誓。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e作为对岩王帝君的效忠，对同胞民众的责任，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e自各处选拔出勇健之士组织成军，号曰千岩。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e与夜叉并肩的那一战中，断后的将士也曾以金爵饮下美酒，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e向慈爱威严的岩王敬最后一杯，随即冲向深渊，义无反顾。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e数百年后，自负的冒险家将之自巨渊深处取回，稍加洗濯，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e金爵在百年之间竟从未破碎锈蚀，亦未被漆黑的气息浸透。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e数百年后，当璃月人再度谈起灾厄年代的往事，谈起那无名的夜叉，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e谈起来自不同背景、不同地域的英雄如何团结一心，对抗深渊浪潮…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e这尊金爵便是不可绕开的话题，其中歃盟的血水恍若依旧清亮无尘。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"8","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"理之冠","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"理之冠：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"理之冠：\",\"value\":[\"将帅兜鍪\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/11/4521515/68ba4ee101dd474d65772ab043c2f8fe_4164682759056836121.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e年代久远的华丽头盔，洗净尘沙后依旧明亮如新。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e与未曾留下名号的夜叉一并奋战的将帅，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e偕屈指可数的同袍为了守护而共同陨落。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e为了保障难民与的安全撤离，不辜负岩主的目光，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e头戴兜鍪的首领们率先向深渊刺出了手中的长枪。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e大灾降临琉璃之地，悠古的仇雠泉涌而出。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜叉应帝君之命，与深渊的扭曲造物血战。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e直至最后一滴血亦汇入大地，将污秽涤除，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e随着深渊的退潮，琉璃砂终又流露出光泽。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e当层岩巨渊上空的重重阴翳消散，夜叉就此消失无踪。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在沙场留下兜鍪的将帅及兵士，亦永远地安眠在此地。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"9","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"搭配推荐","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色推荐\",\"header\":[\"角色名称\",\"推荐原因\",\"词缀搭配\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1290\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/6682780141a9e7788da99c71b1cfd5c3_6751062493374563471.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"钟离\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1290/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1290/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/6682780141a9e7788da99c71b1cfd5c3_6751062493374563471.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e钟离\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e钟离作为吃生命值的护盾角色，二件套效果可提升钟离护盾的生命值；同时，钟离的的元素战技可以持续触发千岩牢固四件套的效果，增加队友的攻击力，提升队友的护盾强效。辅助向钟离首选。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e岩元素伤害加成/生命值百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害/生命值百分比\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509804\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/21/50494840/b9c34f2a1e0428379eb4977e5d4c8d01_1949166060657091505.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"沃雅妮莎\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509804/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509804/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/21/50494840/b9c34f2a1e0428379eb4977e5d4c8d01_1949166060657091505.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e沃雅妮莎\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e提供生命加成，战技命中提高全队攻击力，契合沃雅妮莎攻击频率。辅助攻击倍率优先考虑。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5020\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/08/06/6276411/aad25ff85d04d98abbac7b1cc405ea69_4186120229500438642.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"妮露\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5020/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5020/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/08/06/6276411/aad25ff85d04d98abbac7b1cc405ea69_4186120229500438642.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e妮露\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e千岩牢固与\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"6351\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/07/26/4521515/8024fdf0373b5f642ac17b5117192e46_7931180818303283440.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"花海甘露之光\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6351/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6351/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e花海甘露之光\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e2件套可为妮露提供较高生命值加成。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2403\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/09/21/75379475/5f6f5d0c81155aea5c939ba08249e5d5_6649173224604660824.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"珊瑚宫心海\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2403/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2403/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/09/21/75379475/5f6f5d0c81155aea5c939ba08249e5d5_6649173224604660824.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e珊瑚宫心海\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e珊瑚宫心海元素战技持续时间为12秒，在此期间千岩牢固四件套可以持续为队友增加攻击力。与此同时，千岩牢固二件套效果也可以提高以生命为治疗基础的心海的治疗量。通常是永冻流心海的首选圣遗物。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比/元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比/水元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e治疗加成\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1057\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/02/16/6276411/d7d8e4a15f70e31a16edaa6d7389437f_2242463119371173498.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"莫娜\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1057/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1057/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/02/16/6276411/d7d8e4a15f70e31a16edaa6d7389437f_2242463119371173498.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e莫娜\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e莫娜的元素战技可以在持续时间内持续触发千岩牢固四件套的效果，持续增加队友的攻击力。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e水元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"504976\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/05/01/50494840/cc1d0ae2568f3791339a21ff22b43ed9_6702845488440320041.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"爱可菲\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/504976/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/504976/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/05/01/50494840/cc1d0ae2568f3791339a21ff22b43ed9_6702845488440320041.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e爱可菲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e爱可菲的元素战技可以在持续时间内持续触发千岩牢固四件套的效果，持续增加队友的攻击力，但无法对爱可菲自身的输出产生太多提升。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力/元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e冰元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"6180\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/21/195563531/3499be9a309249e2ddf1a0533af1f4c7_958475410876966785.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"迪希雅\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6180/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6180/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/21/195563531/3499be9a309249e2ddf1a0533af1f4c7_958475410876966785.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e迪希雅\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e迪希雅为生命值攻击力混合倍率的后台副C，2件套效果可以提高迪希雅的伤害和承受伤害能力。迪希雅元素战技可持续触发4件套效果，为队友增加攻击力，常见于辅助流迪希雅玩法，副C流则用4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/6351/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e花海甘露之光\u003c/a\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比/攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比/火元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e生命值百分比/暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5493\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/06/4328207/38a192da1174b705cc6648e854162ab0_6403431489397028121.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"珐露珊\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5493/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5493/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/06/4328207/38a192da1174b705cc6648e854162ab0_6403431489397028121.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e珐露珊\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e珐露珊6命的效果可以在后台自动释放风压坍陷，可以触发千岩牢固4件套，为队友增加攻击力。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e元素充能效率/攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e风元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"]]},{\"tab_name\":\"圣遗物成长数据\",\"header\":[\"